ief in combat against the Banished, a mercenary faction of aliens and humans. Players traverse the environment on foot and in vehicles, capturing forward operating bases, rescuing Marines, and completing story missions that advance the narrative. Equipment such as the Grappleshot adds traversal and combat options. The multiplayer component is free-to-play and includes various competitive modes in 4v4 and 12v12 formats.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/halo-infinite", "videos": [{"id": 27858, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "ZtgzKBrU1GY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZtgzKBrU1GY", "title": "Halo Infinite - E3 2019 - Discover Hope", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZtgzKBrU1GY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 38819, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "Fmdb-KmlzD8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fmdb-KmlzD8", "title": "Halo Infinite - E3 2018 - Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Fmdb-KmlzD8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 38763, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "-E-1BcILTPk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-E-1BcILTPk", "title": "Halo Infinite - Official Campaign Gameplay Premiere", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-E-1BcILTPk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 50901, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "W18OP8BZc6I", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W18OP8BZc6I", "title": "Halo Infinite Official Multiplayer Reveal", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/W18OP8BZc6I/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 53804, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "0iUeDo5p5Pw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0iUeDo5p5Pw", "title": "Halo Infinite Multiplayer - Official Cinematic Trailer | gamescom 2021", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0iUeDo5p5Pw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 144948, "name": "TGA 2021 Trailer", "video_id": "yq3E9uAvYpE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yq3E9uAvYpE", 